      "The little Emperor of Lilliput ordered hundreds of baskets of roast meat and loaves of bread to be hoisted up to my mouth on long wooden ladders, and rolled huge hogsheads of wine down my throat. Thus began my extraordinary captivity and service in the kingdom of Lilliput, a land where tiny human beings possessed great pride, intricate courts, and pompous rivalries that mirrored all the foolish vanities of our own European empires.",
